  m_text: 'Andar Bahar is a simple card game originating from Southern India. There
    are 2 sides to bet on, know as

    "Andar" and "Bahar". The First drawn card
    is placed in the middle, with the remainder being dealt with each side one at
    a time. The first side to match the middle card wins.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3f2622a014bf88f40bf6ea34128ad6b5, type: 2}
